# Names of countries (Apendice C of Documento tecnico B 16-1, version 3): the sign 456 takes
# the place of the capital sign, so the capital sign is removed in a second pass. The name is
# only abbreviated as a whole word: whatever punctuation follows is irrelevant, but a following
# letter means it is another word (Cubano, Costa Ricas). The rules use the match opcode, whose
# pattern can look at what follows; the characters of the name are compared without regard to
# case.
# The match rule puts a marker (dot 7) before the sign. The second pass removes the capital sign
# after it. In lower case the name is another word (cuba, a container; chile, a pepper; 2.2.2.1
# rule 1): the marker and the sign are replaced by the normal spelling of the word.

match (^|!%a) argentina (!%a|^) 7-456-1-1235
noback pass2 @46@7@456@1@1235 @456@1@1235
noback pass2 @46@46@7@456@1@1235 @456@1@1235
noback pass2 @7@456@1@1235 @16@1245@26@2345@35@1
match (^|!%a) bolivia (!%a|^) 7-456-12-135
noback pass2 @46@7@456@12@135 @456@12@135
noback pass2 @46@46@7@456@12@135 @456@12@135
noback pass2 @7@456@12@135 @12@135@123@24@1236@24@1
match (^|!%a) brasil (!%a|^) 7-456-12-1235
noback pass2 @46@7@456@12@1235 @456@12@1235
noback pass2 @46@46@7@456@12@1235 @456@12@1235
noback pass2 @7@456@12@1235 @23@12346@24@123
match (^|!%a) chile (!%a|^) 7-456-14-123
noback pass2 @46@7@456@14@123 @456@14@123
noback pass2 @46@46@7@456@14@123 @456@14@123
noback pass2 @7@456@14@123 @14@125@24@123@15
match (^|!%a) colombia (!%a|^) 7-456-14-135
noback pass2 @46@7@456@14@135 @456@14@135
noback pass2 @46@46@7@456@14@135 @456@14@135
noback pass2 @7@456@14@135 @14@135@123@2456@12@24@1
match (^|!%a) cuba (!%a|^) 7-456-14-136
noback pass2 @46@7@456@14@136 @456@14@136
noback pass2 @46@46@7@456@14@136 @456@14@136
noback pass2 @7@456@14@136 @14@136@12@1
match (^|!%a) ecuador (!%a|^) 7-456-15-14
noback pass2 @46@7@456@15@14 @456@15@14
noback pass2 @46@46@7@456@15@14 @456@15@14
noback pass2 @7@456@15@14 @15@14@136@1456@156
match (^|!%a) españa (!%a|^) 7-456-15-234
noback pass2 @46@7@456@15@234 @456@15@234
noback pass2 @46@46@7@456@15@234 @456@15@234
noback pass2 @7@456@15@234 @1246@1234@1@12456@1
match (^|!%a) guatemala (!%a|^) 7-456-1245-2345
noback pass2 @46@7@456@1245@2345 @456@1245@2345
noback pass2 @46@46@7@456@1245@2345 @456@1245@2345
noback pass2 @7@456@1245@2345 @1245@136@1@2345@126@13@1
match (^|!%a) honduras (!%a|^) 7-456-125-1345
noback pass2 @46@7@456@125@1345 @456@125@1345
